<title>USA: Mayville, Wis., won by Griffin Kubik Stephens.</title>
<headline>Mayville, Wis., won by Griffin Kubik Stephens.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Griffin Kubik Stephens &amp; Thompson of said it won $3.105 million of Mayville, Wis., general obligation corporate purpose bonds, with a true interest cost of 5.26 percent.</p>
</text>
